# The React frontend needs NO build-time secrets — it talks only to the
# same-origin Laravel API. All real configuration lives in backend/.env
# (see backend/.env.example).
#
# Do NOT add API keys here with a VITE_ prefix: anything VITE_* is inlined into
# the browser bundle and is publicly readable. Any third-party integration
# (e.g. AI wording assist) must be proxied through the Laravel backend so the
# key stays server-side.
